{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0414_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0414_story_02_title", "source_sha256": "b8b3579b5be66bb32df7f2bd4f90b42f86810b07394cc38d40365dbf52fc9bd8", "ja": "レッスンは大成功☆", "zh": "课程大成功☆", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0414_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0414_story_02_synopsis", "source_sha256": "abd40bf9d0cf27ea26f241e217cf019d42fda65a3769bec377439210885017b8", "ja": "ひとまず新曲のレッスンが始まった。だが、\n互いがライバルの状態なのに、3人の息は\nぴったり。ダンスの合わせも、他の\nちょっとしたタイミングも。そう、まるで\n誰かが助けてくれているみたいで……。", "zh": "暂且开始了新歌的练习。然而，  \n明明彼此还是竞争对手，3人的配合却  \n天衣无缝。舞蹈动作的配合，还有其他  \n细微的时机把握也是如此。没错，就好像  \n有人在帮忙一样……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0414_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0414_story_02_1000_null", "source_sha256": "0e37993508337361858e65385024909d370d50296c9499791b8fa52d6754ddc3", "ja": "レッスン初日……", "zh": "课程第一天……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0414_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0414_story_02_1001_018ele", "source_sha256": "254da2387601de298d8e2c7d323aed93493276d7febe941d8a96ebaa51333cfd", "ja": "よかった、レッスンはみんな一緒なんだネ♪\n今日は……3人だけ？", "zh": "太好了，大家一起上课呢♪\n今天……只有3个人吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0414_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0414_story_02_1002_048rei", "source_sha256": "2eb19b5ee06cac572634ca2ea91960c4f133ba1e8ece0ff6fb2966d1be6458c6", "ja": "そうみたい！　あずささんたちはTVのお仕事だって。\nレッスンルーム、3人占めだね！　わーい♪", "zh": "好像是这样！听说阿梓她们要去做电视节目相关的工作。\n练习室被我们3个人包场了！好耶♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0414_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0414_story_02_1003_012mam", "source_sha256": "79d92e456d0f7b4b60e231d9817b342981251c024fa3bb9120fc047808dcfed9", "ja": "ということは……\nライバルに差をつけるチャンスだよ、麗花お姉ちゃん！", "zh": "也就是说……  \n这是拉开与竞争对手差距的机会哦，丽花姐姐！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0414_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0414_story_02_1004_048rei", "source_sha256": "f47f39e1017e86e68c2e98de7a8a1edae295193f2ae90aa25d1fdfcfdbd38ab2", "ja": "本当だ！　それじゃあ早速……\nこの3本の靴紐、1本だけ当たりだよ！　選んでみて♪", "zh": "真的！那就马上……\n\n这3根鞋带里，只有1根是中奖的哦！来选一根吧♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0414_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0414_story_02_1005_012mam", "source_sha256": "fc2f07125aa13ad5029ee18f39710ec365792aa95cad4e7b2799721c1ab56128", "ja": "むむっ、高度なカケ算ヒキ算ってヤツだね……\nなら真美は、この一番右の紐を選ぶっ！　とりゃー！", "zh": "唔唔，这就是所谓高深莫测的乘算减算吧……\n那真美就选最右边这根鞋带！看招——！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0414_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0414_story_02_1006_048rei", "source_sha256": "3141c4a06c97812afad8d36597779ab56c8532f6cfbdd3988cea5f984e19b2f6", "ja": "ピンポンピンポン♪　大正解！　真美ちゃんには、\nこのワサビ色の靴紐をプレゼントしちゃいまーす！", "zh": "叮咚叮咚♪ 完全正确！真美，这根芥末色的鞋带就送给你啦——！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0414_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0414_story_02_1007_012mam", "source_sha256": "6da148a4983afbed261f48f9b7451421cc780a4b79c8b1419fe3e7b37e249d9b", "ja": "え、それが正解なの？\nまあせっかくだから使うけど。", "zh": "诶，那就是正确答案吗？\n不过难得你送我，我就用用看吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0414_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0414_story_02_1008_018ele", "source_sha256": "5a28a5f89e4234d57b4dcfae44b298c3124a414d7d10395e0824ee3dd55910ac", "ja": "ほらほらふたりとも、遊んでないでレッスンしなきゃ\nダメだヨ～！　通しでダンス、合わせてみよっ。", "zh": "喂喂，你们两个别玩了，得去练习才行哦～！把整段舞蹈合一遍试试吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0414_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0414_story_02_1009_012mam", "source_sha256": "5092353fc40aba40a8eca83824feb5f4903fcbc98399cb850a4efef79e266e92", "ja": "ラジャー！　まあ最初だし合わないだろうけど、\n軽～くね、軽～く……。", "zh": "收到！不过毕竟是第一次，应该合不到一起吧，\n先轻～轻地来，轻～轻地……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0414_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0414_story_02_1010_se", "source_sha256": "a9fab46ac0b55fe845f91933e7067e643b4c27d60b80877f067c097462081583", "ja": "……ピカッ☆", "zh": "……闪亮☆", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0414_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0414_story_02_1011_018ele", "source_sha256": "a188c6e0cbf0fe90bd61fb2eb68ee2e19ac2cbaeaab60cde14ff6a3409790015", "ja": "やーっ！", "zh": "呀——！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0414_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0414_story_02_1012_012mam", "source_sha256": "7b2cac7fe1fac8217da0f2f6f82dbea59f163ad24e1276504aaf89088cbe4c0d", "ja": "はーっ！", "zh": "哈——！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0414_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0414_story_02_1013_048rei", "source_sha256": "cb14c4a8ed82b2d910fc86cb37e63b6e7de50c19600aa154427d689543da92b2", "ja": "えーいっ☆", "zh": "嘿——！☆", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0414_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0414_story_02_1014_012mam", "source_sha256": "4d9be6fe9904fad32748d2008063c52a82e036bf4baa0945f4f19443ebfe4709", "ja": "……えーっ！？　全部ピッタリ合っちゃった！\nこんなことってある？", "zh": "……诶——！？竟然全都刚好对上了！\n居然会有这种事？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0414_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0414_story_02_1015_018ele", "source_sha256": "f6dcfa0e0f1b474aa8b9397904b222fa5dbb206ff172d0c63518da30f45ded03", "ja": "すごーい！　ワタシも、初めてかも？\n次にどう動いたらいいか、全部わかっちゃったヨ！", "zh": "太厉害了！我可能也是第一次遇到这种情况吧？\n接下来该怎么行动，我全都明白了哟！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0414_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0414_story_02_1016_048rei", "source_sha256": "2e3bf456183ed26a2cb4a85543b51fbd24923860b45859dce431602669b12a33", "ja": "私も、体が勝手に動いちゃった。\nすごいすご～い！　私たち、息ピッタリだね♪", "zh": "我的身体也不由自主地动起来了。\n好厉害好厉害～！我们配合得真默契呢♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0414_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0414_story_02_1017_018ele", "source_sha256": "6990e078f7ac70f046e586b15a698c8cd5fc2de04fc88f13502c6e7586e51cc8", "ja": "そうだネ～♪　えーっと……。", "zh": "就是这样呢～♪　那个……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0414_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0414_story_02_1018_se", "source_sha256": "4081a8c211e3025b0596941749fd73038b49f812487e142a6868438cd14220b4", "ja": "キラキラキラ……ピカッ☆", "zh": "闪闪发光……啪地一闪☆", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0414_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0414_story_02_1019_048rei", "source_sha256": "8a41c2c3ee0fac9b91d44505f3fbba27be24da39c91ce8ea9945bc0963a38f3b", "ja": "はい、エレナちゃん！　タオルだよ♪", "zh": "给，艾莲娜！毛巾哦♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0414_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0414_story_02_1020_018ele", "source_sha256": "232094dd6b26db2dab8366c575037bd3a797be37ce4de5fb433578f1bacf4669", "ja": "エッ、アレッ？　ありがとネ、レイカ……\n今ワタシ、タオル取ってって言った？", "zh": "咦，那个？谢谢你，丽花……\n我刚才是说了要你拿毛巾来吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0414_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0414_story_02_1021_048rei", "source_sha256": "61d6d7dd5bf3a703282ee4e58e31993a9680de51dcbde502e1a4740a3dbf36d0", "ja": "ううん？　なんとなく、いるかな～って。\nあと、はいこれ！　タオル掛けも。", "zh": "没有呀？只是觉得你大概会需要～\n还有，给！毛巾架也给你。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0414_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0414_story_02_1022_018ele", "source_sha256": "206fa90474f144e0e7c1f937efb73e50eef99c94ae996fbd1681d022c06c10c3", "ja": "ウン、それはいらないケド。", "zh": "嗯，那个就不用了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0414_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0414_story_02_1023_012mam", "source_sha256": "1df950de2e97615fe29d66b270bd835c71a33a28ec360962428bdb0f20044364", "ja": "うーん、ここのステップをもう少しセクシーに……\nっと、わ、わわっ！？", "zh": "嗯～，这里的舞步要再性感一点……啊，哇、哇哇！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0414_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0414_story_02_1024_se", "source_sha256": "9775d1fe4ac24a8b539b2d55e4626415a64daaab7e43fcf2345b82862cd52050", "ja": "ピカッ☆", "zh": "闪亮☆", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0414_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0414_story_02_1025_018ele", "source_sha256": "263c2b509cdd6cbbeba94dbc484e3f0b5e6c62a0eb2125de964e777209159517", "ja": "マミ！？　危なーいっ！", "zh": "真美！？危险——！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0414_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0414_story_02_1026_se", "source_sha256": "0a0b8ecf86904f8ecbd1d5f1eb67d85888620fb9fcb8e16303299baadbc9870c", "ja": "ガシッ！", "zh": "抓紧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0414_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0414_story_02_1027_012mam", "source_sha256": "dc8bbe50d8f0fb9271a3157a05d0af7a774a22511a2bf78891bb51457744283d", "ja": "わわっ……え、えれなん！？\nきゅ～ん……♪", "zh": "哇哇……诶、艾蕾娜！？\n啾～……♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0414_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0414_story_02_1028_048rei", "source_sha256": "1f208756f62fabb032092eeb2d2f46b53bc20c7ec3eaac7bb91e7e2bc94c4bae", "ja": "わあ～っ、エレナちゃんすごい！\n今の、レスキューの人みたいだったよ♪", "zh": "哇～，艾莲娜好厉害！\n刚才就像救援队员一样呢♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0414_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0414_story_02_1029_018ele", "source_sha256": "34c2c09120ce66e87f87cbe7c2afaeefb74f74b4a34a31376dfd194031cd9a89", "ja": "ふぅ……とっさに体が動いちゃったヨ。\nとにかく、マミにケガがなくてよかった～！", "zh": "呼……身体下意识就动起来了。总之，真美没受伤真是太好了～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0414_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0414_story_02_1030_048rei", "source_sha256": "4b5478cc7e03a98584da0fcad1ce5bd88b7abacaf7210c11f6026a25a7df1085", "ja": "ふふっ。なんだか私たち、息ピッタリだね♪", "zh": "呵呵。总觉得我们配合得真默契呢♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0414_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0414_story_02_1031_018ele", "source_sha256": "a09f06b7bc88192acec1740825020c11e8af7f4af2f9ffa05662a83ee988f5a3", "ja": "エヘヘ♪　ライバルだけど、同じチームだもんネ！\n……あ、見て！　スポドリが置いてあるヨ。", "zh": "嘿嘿♪　虽然是竞争对手，但我们可是同一个队伍的嘛！\n……啊，你看！那里放着运动饮料哦。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0414_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0414_story_02_1032_048rei", "source_sha256": "036823cd0d8d06426b10e7b4b8471860b8eb832f4bd1eb65976b450961a2800c", "ja": "本当だ、{$P$}さんが用意して\nくれたのかな？　私たちの名前も書いてあるね。", "zh": "真的，{$P$}先生是特意准备的吗？\n上面还写着我们的名字呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0414_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0414_story_02_1033_012mam", "source_sha256": "6dfb85775fcd13239155178125f1fc2e4e2a79dd34540236e54e5bcf4bda9e09", "ja": "あ、メモがついてる！　『お疲れさま』……\nでも、兄ちゃんの字じゃないね。誰だろ？", "zh": "啊，贴着张便签！上面写着“辛苦了”……\n不过，这不是哥哥的字呢。会是谁写的？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0414_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0414_story_02_1034_018ele", "source_sha256": "7295b2b9a8e799f2419604da6c0a17025ea602fdd748ede8c925a4c3e19a1373", "ja": "ウーン……？", "zh": "嗯……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
